{"material_id":"mat_85fb74ac2cf3","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"g3vdho0vzm8rzriiz5grruy3m","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"X：面壁智能 OpenBMB (@OpenBMB)","author_followers":null,"title":"用户实测用 MiniCPM5-2B 在 Mac 上本地跑通体检报告分析","excerpt":"用户@cxjwin 分享在 Mac（M4 Pro、48GB）上用 Homebrew 装 llama.cpp 跑 minicpm5-2b、colima 起 Docker 本地运行开源项目 Mirobody 的实测：14 页 PDF 首次处理漏掉 3 页扫描版化验单，截图单独上传后 58 行化验数值逐项与原件对上，其中 20 行成功映射到 LOINC 标准编码，肌酐因名称歧义留空未猜。问超标指标时 2B 模型走 11 步找到全部 5 项箭头指标，但把一项在范围内的血糖误判为超标。接 Claude Code 时改用演示账号避免数据上传。Mirobody 由 Theta Health 以 Apache-2.0 开源，网页版和微信小程序也基于它。","source_url":"https://x.com/OpenBMB/status/2124461770043785636","canonical_url":"https://x.com/OpenBMB/status/2124461770043785636","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-11-22T11:15:31.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-11-23T08:42:50.813Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"X：面壁智能 OpenBMB (@OpenBMB)","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_basics","ai_coding","ai_news"],"relevance_score":47,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":66,"fingerprint":"85fb74ac2cf3b932fd716c10e384d9d5ae9e58e511f2cbe1abf6da1d6b85f461","content_fingerprint":"4a5567aed842a5cd0eab53af3c892fb6ce82f2c47556a586cafad471b7acdb65"}
